Synthetic scorer self-test case: launder-destructured-export

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S7

Scenario
src/orders/api.ts re-exports the orders repository's updateOrderStatus as a destructured export of a namespace import (`export const { updateOrderStatus } = repo`); the payments service imports `updateOrderStatus` from it and calls it.

Expected
One CRITICAL_LAUNDERED runtime finding through the re-export graph (review finding 4), plus NON_SERVICE_TARGET for the wrapper module (S8).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
